Netlink netfilter: Fix a pre-commit check

epan/dissectors/packet-netlink-netfilter.c:  FT_UINT32:        proto_tree_add_item(tree, hf_nfq_hwaddr_addr, tvb, offset, addrlen, [[ENC_BIG_ENDIAN]-->[ENC_NA]]);

